<title>DENMARK: Sophus Berendsen buys Norwegian laundry.</title>
<headline>Sophus Berendsen buys Norwegian laundry.</headline>
<dateline>COPENHAGEN 1997-06-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Danish holding company Sophus Berendsen said on Wednesday its textile division had signed a letter of intent to purchase Norway's Lillehammer Vask &amp; Rens Laundry for an undisclosed sum.</p>
<p>&quot;The purchase strengthens Berendsen's market-leading position for laundry services for hotels and hotel chains throughout Norway,&quot; the firm said in a statement.</p>
<p>Lillehammer Vask &amp; Rens has an annual turnover of some 28 million Norwegian crowns with 55 employees, it said. --Ole Mikkelsen, Copenhagen newsroom +45-33969652</p>
</text>
